@FileStorageDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 获取文件分类信息（服务端上传）
GET {{FileStorageDemo_HostAddress}}/api/FileUploadWeb/GetUploadInfo/server-upload
Accept: application/json

### 获取文件分类信息（客户端直传）
GET {{FileStorageDemo_HostAddress}}/api/FileUploadWeb/GetUploadInfo/client-upload
Accept: application/json

### ★ 获取客户端直传签名 URL（需存储实现为 OSS/MinIO，Local 仅返回访问地址）
GET {{FileStorageDemo_HostAddress}}/api/FileUploadWeb/GetClientUploadInfo/client-upload
Accept: application/json

### 服务端中转上传（Postman 可用，VSCode REST Client 不支持 multipart）
### POST {{FileStorageDemo_HostAddress}}/api/FileUploadWeb/Upload/server-upload
### Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
###
### --boundary
### Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
### Content-Type: text/plain
###
### Hello World!
### --boundary--
